1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:06,640
When fresh grass dresses the floor, the
quiet call of blessing begins.

2
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:15,150
The cups are set on the tray, waiting with
longing for family.

3
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:21,380
When the roasted smoke rises, no words are
needed to call us.

4
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:30,620
From every room, the aroma draws us
together one by one.

5
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:44,460
Abol, the first round, sparks our laughter
and shared stories.

6
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:52,560
With Tona, the thread of memory passes
gently to younger hands.

7
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:59,370
Timeless stories come alive once more in
listening ears.

8
00:01:00,300 --> 00:01:07,660
Bereka, the blessing cup, seals enduring
love and peace.

9
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:15,390
Wherever we are in the world, this is what
home smells like.
